        },
        {
          "text": "Identify the 3-4 primary thematic pillars of \"growth mindset\" research in education (e.g., \"Impact on Academic Achievement,\" \"Influence on Student Motivation,\" \"Methodological Critiques\").",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 98,
          "source": "prompt-report-least-to-most-prompting-and-its-application-in-academic-report-generation-20251120090939.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "For each identified pillar, conduct a simulated search to find 3 seminal or highly-cited academic papers.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 100,
          "source": "prompt-report-least-to-most-prompting-and-its-application-in-academic-report-generation-20251120090939.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "For each of the selected papers, write a concise summary (approx. 150 words) covering its core argument, methodology, and key findings.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 102,
          "source": "prompt-report-least-to-most-prompting-and-its-application-in-academic-report-generation-20251120090939.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "For each pillar, synthesize the summaries of its associated papers, highlighting areas of scholarly consensus, ongoing debate, and methodological variations.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 104,
          "source": "prompt-report-least-to-most-prompting-and-its-application-in-academic-report-generation-20251120090939.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Conclude by writing a final synthesis paragraph that identifies a clear research gap based on the analysis of all pillars.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 106,
          "source": "prompt-report-least-to-most-prompting-and-its-application-in-academic-report-generation-20251120090939.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Identify the 3 major historical epochs in computational protein folding (e.g., \"Physics-Based Models,\" \"Statistical and Co-evolutionary Methods,\" \"Deep Learning Revolution\").",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 115,
          "source": "prompt-report-least-to-most-prompting-and-its-application-in-academic-report-generation-20251120090939.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "For each epoch, identify 2-3 key algorithms or models that defined the period.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 117,
          "source": "prompt-report-least-to-most-prompting-and-its-application-in-academic-report-generation-20251120090939.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "For each algorithm/model, explain its core mechanism and its primary limitations that motivated the next epoch.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 119,
          "source": "prompt-report-least-to-most-prompting-and-its-application-in-academic-report-generation-20251120090939.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Synthesize the trajectory of progress, explaining how the limitations of one epoch were addressed by the innovations of the next.",
          "indent_level": 2,
          "line_number": 121,
          "source": "prompt-report-least-to-most-prompting-and-its-application-in-academic-report-generation-20251120090939.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Conclude by identifying the current state-of-the-art and outlining the most pressing open questions in the field.",
